# Force LF line endings for all text files regardless of the cloning
# machine's core.autocrlf setting. Without this, a Windows clone with
# autocrlf=true rewrites every file to CRLF on checkout, which then fails
# `prettier --check` (Prettier normalizes to LF) even though the file was
# correctly formatted when committed.
* text=auto eol=lf

*.pdf -text binary
*.docx -text binary
